{"attack":"利用超能力将自己和对手的防御和特防相加，再进行平分。","description":"将使用者的防御与目标的防御相加之后取其算术平均数，相加时不计算能力变化。\n防御较高的一方防御降低超过平均数的部分，防御较低的一方防御增加不足平均数的部分。\n将使用者的特防与目标的特防相加之后取其算术平均数，相加时不计算能力变化。\n特防较高的一方特防降低超过平均数的部分，特防较低的一方特防增加不足平均数的部分。\n防守平分一定会命中，除非目标正在使用蓄力的招式并不在场地上。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Shuckle","Level":35},{"Name":"Baltoy","Level":36},{"Name":"Claydol","Level":38},{"Name":"Latias","Level":65},{"Name":"Yamask","Level":48},{"Name":"Yamask form:galarian","Level":48},{"Name":"Cofagrigus","Level":56},{"Name":"Elgyem","Level":24},{"Name":"Beheeyem","Level":24},{"Name":"Carbink","Level":5},{"Name":"Diancie","Level":7},{"Name":"Hoopa form:confined","Level":29},{"Name":"Hoopa form:unbound","Level":29},{"Name":"Nihilego","Level":25},{"Name":"Wooloo","Level":12},{"Name":"Wooloo form:shorn","Level":12},{"Name":"Dubwool","Level":12},{"Name":"Dubwool form:shorn","Level":12},{"Name":"Runerigus","Level":56},{"Name":"Indeedee form:female","Level":45}],"tutorMoves":[],"eggMoves":["Abra","Kadabra","Alakazam","Rhyhorn","Rhydon","Spinda","Shieldon","Bastiodon","Rhyperior","Shelmet","Accelgor"],"trMoves":[],"hmMoves":[],"transferMoves":["Rhyhorn","Rhydon","Shieldon","Bastiodon","Rhyperior"],"tmMoves9":[],"tmMoves8":[],"tmMoves7":[],"tmMoves6":[],"tmMoves5":[],"tmMoves4":[],"tmMoves3":[],"tmMoves2":[],"tmMoves1":[],"tmMoves":[]}